silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_03_concrete_anchor_4#dailyportiongrams silm:hasLongDescription "The DailyPortionGrams is the daily portion in grams (60g). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Constituent5,2', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
